{"page":{"id":"d2f9468a-5c42-4634-9e68-8bc1da6d4140","theme":"attack-on-titan","slug":"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps/eren-yeager","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/attack-on-titan/survey-corps/eren-yeager","title":"Eren Yeager","meta_title":"Eren Yeager (Attack on Titan) — person, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"Eren Yeager is a youth from Shiganshina who vows to destroy the Titans after Wall Maria falls, later inheriting the Attack Titan and driving the story's…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Protagonist and holder of the <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans/attack-titan\" class=\"entity-link\">Attack Titan</a>.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans/attack-titan\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Attack Titan</strong></a>, <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans/founding-titan\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Founding Titan</strong></a>, <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/warrior-unit/zeke-yeager\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Zeke Yeager</strong></a>, <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps/mikasa-ackerman\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Mikasa Ackerman</strong></a>, <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps/armin-arlert\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Armin Arlert</strong></a> and <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Survey Corps</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Eren Yeager connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Uses:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans/attack-titan\" class=\"entity-link\">Attack Titan</a>\n            — Eren inherits and uses the <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans/attack-titan\" class=\"entity-link\">Attack Titan</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Uses:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans/founding-titan\" class=\"entity-link\">Founding Titan</a>\n            — Eren later wields the <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans/founding-titan\" class=\"entity-link\">Founding Titan</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/warrior-unit/zeke-yeager\" class=\"entity-link\">Zeke Yeager</a>\n            — Eren and Zeke are half-brothers.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Supports:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps/mikasa-ackerman\" class=\"entity-link\">Mikasa Ackerman</a>\n            — Mikasa protects and stays beside Eren.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Supports:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps/armin-arlert\" class=\"entity-link\">Armin Arlert</a>\n            — Armin and Eren share a lifelong bond.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Member Of:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps\" class=\"entity-link\">Survey Corps</a>\n            — Eren joins the <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps\" class=\"entity-link\">Survey Corps</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/hajime-isayama\" class=\"entity-link\">Hajime Isayama</a>\n            — <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/hajime-isayama\" class=\"entity-link\">Hajime Isayama</a> is connected to Eren Yeager through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/paradis/wall-maria/shiganshina\" class=\"entity-link\">Shiganshina District</a>\n            — Eren Yeager is connected to <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/paradis/wall-maria/shiganshina\" class=\"entity-link\">Shiganshina District</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">5</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/attack-on-titan/warrior-unit/zeke-yeager\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Zeke Yeager</strong>\n                    <span>Beast Titan; Eren&#039;s half-brother.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/attack-on-titan/hajime-isayama\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Hajime Isayama</strong>\n                    <span>Creator of Attack on Titan.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/attack-on-titan/paradis/wall-maria/shiganshina\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Shiganshina District</strong>\n                    <span>Southern district on Wall Maria; Eren&#039;s hometown.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/warrior-unit/zeke-yeager\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Zeke Yeager\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Eren and Zeke are half-brothers.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/hajime-isayama\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Hajime Isayama\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Hajime Isayama is connected to Eren Yeager through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/paradis/wall-maria/shiganshina\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Shiganshina District\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Eren Yeager is connected to Shiganshina District through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/paradis/wall-maria\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Wall Maria\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Eren Yeager is connected to Wall Maria through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans\" class=\"