               <h3>\n        <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans/founding-titan\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Founding Titan\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Eren later wields the Founding Titan.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Supports</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">2</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Supports\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps/mikasa-ackerman\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Mikasa Ackerman\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Mikasa protects and stays beside Eren.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Supports\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps/armin-arlert\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Armin Arlert\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Armin and Eren share a lifelong bond.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Member Of</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div c